{"title":"33","section":"3610","heading":"Authorization of appropriations","lead":"There are authorized to be appropriated to the Secretary of Commerce to support the integrated oceans observations under this chapter—","tree":[{"marker":"(1)","path":"(1)","heading":"","text":"$48,000,000 for fiscal year 2021;","children":[]},{"marker":"(2)","path":"(2)","heading":"","text":"$50,000,000 for fiscal year 2022;","children":[]},{"marker":"(3)","path":"(3)","heading":"","text":"$52,000,000 for fiscal year 2023;","children":[]},{"marker":"(4)","path":"(4)","heading":"","text":"$54,000,000 for fiscal year 2024; and","children":[]},{"marker":"(5)","path":"(5)","heading":"","text":"$56,000,000 for fiscal year 2025.","children":[]}],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"amendments","text":"Amendments2020—Pub. L. 116–271 amended section generally. Prior to amendment, section related to authorization of appropriations for fiscal years 2009 to 2013."}],"sourceCredit":"(Pub. L. 111–11, title XII, § 12311, Mar. 30, 2009, 123 Stat. 1436; Pub. L. 116–271, title I, § 108, Dec. 31, 2020, 134 Stat. 3341.)","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 33—","heading":"NAVIGATION AND NAVIGABLE WATERS","identifier":"/us/usc/t33"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 49—","heading":"INTEGRATED COASTAL AND OCEAN OBSERVATION SYSTEM","identifier":"/us/usc/t33/ch49"}]}